      "message": "Is this used anywhere?\n\nIn AIDL all of the methods have that built-in Status return, and we have been encouraging HAL teams to use the ServiceSpecificErrors to report the errors using that built in Status return.\n\nThat\u0027s a bit easier to use with `const int ERROR_CAS_NO_LICENSE` defined in an interface somewhere instead of an enum, because these enumerators will all need to be cast to an int to be used there (they are `enum class` in AIDL).\n\nhttps://source.android.com/docs/core/architecture/aidl/aidl-backends#error_handling",
